{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>וישע.</b> Rashi explained: 'he turned,' and so אל ישעו (let them not turn). This verse is not in Isaiah, nor is it 'ואל ישעו בדברי שקר' — for if so, it would be a difficulty both from here and from there."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {0 "The Hebrew text as given is partially corrupt: 'פרש״י' appears to read 'פירש״י' (Rashi explained); 'חז״ק' is obscure and rendered here as 'this verse is not in Isaiah' based on context; the final phrase 'מיניה וביה' is translated literally though the argument it references is uncertain."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:02:54.473231495Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}